  "bodyHash": "w74CWnDPe2U=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:36px\"><strong>略</strong><strong>有</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>所</strong></span><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:36px\"> <strong>成</strong><strong>效</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90;font-size:36px\"><strong>描</strong></span><span style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:36px\"><strong>述</strong></span></span><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0;font-size:36px\"> <strong>（</strong></span><span style=\"color:#0f0;font-size:36px\"><strong>JE</strong></span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:36px\"><strong>ED</strong> </span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#008080\"><strong>）</strong></span></span></span><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"color:#f60\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><span style=\"color:#fc0\"><span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong><span style=\"color:#0f0\"><span style=\"color:#008000\"><span style=\"color:#008080\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">状</span><span style=\"color:#0ff\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">态</span><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:36px\">效</span><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">果</span><span style=\"color:#800080;font-size:36px\">描</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 关于&nbsp;📖</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">“略有成效描述”（JEED）是一个 JEI/REI/EMI 插件，提供关于状态效果的有用信息。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 该模组添加了一个新的效果配方分类，可以通过点击 JEI 物品界面上新添加的状态效果图标，或者点击物品栏界面中活跃效果框来访问。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在这里，你可以查看关于状态效果的信息，比如能提供该效果的物品、其描述、来源模组以及效果颜色等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/P8qv5ZN.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UfGgoGG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"313\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🧪 自定义🧪</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组会自动将所有注册的状态效果添加到其页面中，但模组添加的效果默认没有描述。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;任何人都可以通过在资源包的语言文件中添加字符串 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">\"effect.[模组ID].[效果名称].description\"</span>，轻松为自己的效果添加描述。理想情况下，这应该由模组作者自己完成。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">作为模组作者，你也可以使用 <em>JeedAPI</em> 类为你的界面注册屏幕扩展，或使用原版类告诉 Jeed 效果的渲染位置，使其可点击。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由于模组只能自动检测食物类物品作为效果提供者，模组开发者也可以通过在其模组中添加一些配方来轻松支持自定义效果或提供效果的物品。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为此，你可以简单使用以下两种新添加的配方类别之一：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:effect_provider\"</em>，允许你指定一个可以提供效果的物品，格式如下：</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:effect_provider\",<br>  \"effect\":  \"minecraft:haste\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:beacon\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n<p>该 JSON 还可以包含键 \"fluid_providers\" 和 \"effect_providers\"，它们可以分别持有流体或效果的标签或列表。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>\"jeed:potion_provider\"</em>，允许你指定一个可以包含任何已注册药水的物品，例如药箭：</span></li>\n</ul><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre>{<br>  \"type\": \"jeed:potion_provider\",<br>  \"providers\": [<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:splash_potion\"<br>    },<br>    {<br>      \"item\": \"minecraft:tipped_arrow\"<br>    }<br>  ]<br>}</pre>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果你愿意帮助我为许多模组效果提供内置描述支持，请务必通过我的 Discord 联系我！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️ 支持我 ❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模组制作花费了我大量时间，所以如果你喜欢我的作品并想支持我，你可以在这里支持。如果你这样做了，你将获得一个定制的<strong>地球仪</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 从 Akliz 购买服务器，也同样适用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？看看 Akliz，他们拥有专为模组 Minecraft 打造的高端服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们确实有一个温馨的社区，提供出色的支持，服务器运行起来也非常棒。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享受<strong> 8 折优惠</strong>，同时也支持了我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yXOxl9R.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组 🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a> </span></span></p>",
